sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Link sw-a to sw-b
  participant R as Ryu app
  participant T as Telemetry
  participant H as Decision + Healing
  participant X as LiveExecutor
  participant O as Dashboard
  L--xR: probes lost (physical cut)
  T->>R: GET /sh/stats/links
  R-->>T: loss 100 %, carrier up
  T->>H: link DOWN (health event)
  H->>H: risk above threshold: RESTORE + REROUTE
  H->>X: execute REROUTE
  X->>R: PUT /sh/routes (pin via rtr-core)
  R-->>X: path installed
  H->>H: verify: client/server pings answered
  H-->>O: REROUTE VERIFIED
  H->>X: execute RESTORE (reconnect)
  H->>H: verify: link still down
  H-->>O: RESTORE ESCALATED (physical damage)
